## Validation Checklist
- [ ] All original exports preserved
- [ ] No function implementations changed
- [ ] All linting passing
- [ ] No new bugs introduced
- [ ] Clear file organization
- [ ] Minimal dependencies between files
- [ ] Documentation maintained
- [ ] Performance unchanged
- [ ] All files less than 500 lines
- [ ] Original file has all varibles and functions that were moved removed from that file
- [ ] No two files have the same function repeated

